      "id": "claim_b39405ee300a4ed0beecc70967699c90",
      "statement": "The WSP application supports three primary digital wallet payment methods: Apple Pay, Google Pay, and Samsung Pay, each processed through a dedicated service class (PaymentServiceApple, PaymentServiceGoogle, SamSungPayTransaction) that decrypts the wallet token via a PSP and then creates a payment via the MSP.",
