    {
      "id": "claim_81ca73af256f4c7c8ef1af179091f95e",
      "statement": "The DigitalWalletMerchantDecrypt class exposes a generic merchant-driven wallet endpoint POST /vpc/merchants/:merchant_id/digital-wallet/:merchTxnRef: it validates the VPC request (vpc_Version, vpc_Command, vpc_Amount, vpc_Instrument up to 8000 chars, etc.), base64-encodes the whole body into merchant_data (up to 16000 chars), and forwards it to the MSP for decryption and processing.",
